# Who you're selling to

Insurance brokerages — independent agencies, MGAs, wholesalers, regional carriers' direct arms. Anywhere commissions and producer compensation drive the P&amp;L.

<div class="cols three">
<div class="card">

### **CFO / Controller**
Owns the close. Cares about audit-readiness, transaction completeness, GL integrity. Buys on **time-to-close** and **error rate**.

</div>
<div class="card">

### **VP Operations**
Owns the back office. Cares about staff time, throughput, productivity. Buys on **headcount avoidance** and **SLA compliance**.

</div>
