# Objection handling

The three things you'll hear. The three things to say.

---

# Top three objections

The patterns are universal. The answers are the same every time.

- **"We're already on [X]."** → "Great. Unite sits next to [X], not against. Let me show you the integration footprint." (Open the integration diagram.)
- **"Your AI scares my auditors."** → "AI suggests; humans approve. Every line has provenance. Every transition has a workflow history row. Audit-ready by design."
- **"What's your roadmap?"** → "HSO acquired this from OneDigital. Phase 3 is the AI feature pipeline. You're not buying a snapshot — you're buying a product on an HSO investment trajectory."

*Net: 80% of objections are these three. Memorize the answers.*

---

